# New signup

For first minute, we show "join lottery (ends at 19:01)". 

Assign a lottery ticket to every attendee who joins in lottery period
Add `lottery_drawn = False` on events

If lottery drawn is false:
    If < signup + 1 min, do nothing, display the event as "waiting for lottery / join lottery"
        - Don't allow payment in this window!
    If >= signup + 1 min, do the draw once with a big lock (setting is_waiting_list as appropriate)
else:
    Work as normal

# New membership

Add a "trial start date" to each member (which may be missing). This, together with the "membership_expiry_date" we currently have, is then is enough information for us to tell if they are a non-member, trial member, member, or lapsed member.
i. Expired membership => lapsed member
ii. Current membership => member
iii. No membership, trial expired (or more than 4 events) => lapsed member
iv. No membership, trial valid => trial member
v. No membership, no trial start => non-member